Modifications
-------------

As required by Section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0, the following changes
have been made to the original BrowserGym sources in this repository:

  * `experiments/src/browsergym/experiments/loop.py`
    The call to `save_package_versions(self.exp_dir)` in `ExpArgs.run()` is
    commented out, so per-task Python environment snapshots are no longer
    written to the experiment directory.

